If those videos were added, it might also be helpful to either:
remove the Dutch voice-over, or
include English subtitles.
Of course, if the reference to the three scenarios is removed entirely from the game, this suggestion can simply be ignored!

Thanks again for the great work so far! We are really happy with how the materials are shaping up and appreciate your openness to these suggestions.

